        "openmrs_entity_id": "",
        "type": "toaster_notes",
        "text": "Counseling: Silent Killer\n\nIt is very good that you are feeling better! However, Diabetes and High Blood Pressure are lifelong conditions often called 'silent killers' because they cause serious damage to the heart, kidneys, and eyes \u2014 even when you feel no symptoms at all.\n\nStopping medication when you feel well is one of the most dangerous mistakes. Your medication keeps your blood pressure and blood sugar under control. Without it, the damage continues silently.\n\nPlease continue taking your medication every day, even when you feel perfectly well.",
        "toaster_type": "warning",
        "relevance": {
